{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42244","headline":"题伏龟山北隅 · 徐铉","name":"题伏龟山北隅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兹山信岑寂，阴崖积苍翠。\n水石何必多，宛有千岩意。\n孰知近人境，旦暮含佳气。\n池影摇轻风，林光澹新霁。\n支颐藉芳草，自足忘世事。\n未得归去来，聊爲宴居地。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42244.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42244","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}